      <title>Arts Awards Ceremony celebrates student excellence across theatre, music, dance, visual arts and performance programs</title>
                                                                  
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      <link>https://www.lsmsa.edu/page/news-detail?pk=1680166&amp;nc=20751&amp;fromId=249284</link>
                                                                  
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      <description>The Louisiana School for Math, Science, and the Arts recently celebrated student achievement across its Creative and Performing Arts Department during the annual CAPA Department Awards Ceremony, recognizing excellence in theatre, technical theatre, visual arts, dance, music, piano, voice and chorale performance.</description>
                                                                  
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
